# POTION — a stoppered round-bulb flask (the '!' loot). Loot may POP (brighter than mobs):
# crimson liquid in dark glass, cork stopper, one highlight. Dark glass rim = readability.
# (The unknown-items system shows flavours by NAME; the sprite stays one generic flask.)
# Source for assets/sprites/potion.png.
size 256x256
Background transparent
name glass_bulb
Circle (0.50,0.60) r=0.225 rgb=54,58,70
name glass_neck
Poly (0.435,0.28) (0.565,0.28) (0.565,0.50) (0.435,0.50) rgb=54,58,70
name liquid
Circle (0.50,0.61) r=0.190 rgb=178,40,48
name neck_liquid
Poly (0.465,0.44) (0.535,0.44) (0.535,0.52) (0.465,0.52) rgb=178,40,48
name cork
Poly (0.445,0.175) (0.555,0.175) (0.555,0.30) (0.445,0.30) rgb=150,112,68
Poly (0.445,0.175) (0.555,0.175) (0.555,0.21) (0.445,0.21) rgb=122,90,52
name highlight
Circle (0.425,0.535) r=0.040 rgb=236,210,212
Circle (0.44,0.50) r=0.022 rgb=246,238,238
